subject: fix(usage): correct OpenRouter handler to real /api/v1/key credit mapping (BUG-QUOTA-03-b)

Sibling commit a2d53af4 landed the handler but mapped a non-existent
`credits` object and labeled credit figures as token quotas. Per official
OpenRouter docs the /api/v1/key response carries USD credit figures:
usage (all-time), limit (key credit cap, null=unlimited),
limit_remaining (remaining, null=unlimited).

- Single `credits` quota row with used/total/remaining + remainingPercentage,
