- Uses documented https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/key (registry usage.url still
  carries the legacy /auth/key alias; both routes exist, docs one preferred)
- buildOpenRouterQuota exported for direct unit coverage
- Tests: paid tier (limit_remaining), free tier (no data), unlimited key,
  missing key / 401 / 429, UI normalizer row — 11/11 pass on mini3

